{{also|Appendix:Variations of "ot"}}
==Bulgarian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|bg}} {{term|*otъ|lang=sla-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{qualifier|stressed}} {{IPA|/ɔt̪/|lang=bg}}
* {{qualifier|unstressed}} {{IPA|/o̝t̪/|/ut̪/|lang=bg}}

===Preposition===
{{head|bg|preposition|tr=ot|sc=Cyrl}}

# ''used to indicate movement away from a position'', [[from#Preposition|from]], [[away]] [[from]], [[out of#Preposition|out of]], [[off#Preposition|off]]
#: {{lang|bg|прибирам се '''от''' работа}}
#:: pribiram se ot rabota
#:: to come home from work''
#: {{lang|bg|излизам '''от''' стаята}}
#:: izlizam ot stajata
#:: to go out of the room''
#: {{lang|bg|падам '''от''' стълба}}
#:: padam ot stǎlba
#:: to fall off a ladder''
#: {{lang|bg|ставам '''от''' масата}}
#:: stavam ot masata
#:: to get up from the table''
#: {{lang|bg|далеч '''от'''}}
#:: daleč ot
#:: far from''
# ''used to indicate the position relative to which something is'', [[from#Preposition|from]], [[on#Preposition|on]], [[of#Preposition|of]]
#: {{lang|bg|Сградата е на десет километра '''от''' епицентъра.}}
#:: Sgradata e na deset kilometra ot epicentǎra.
#:: The building is ten kilometres from the epicentre.''
#: {{lang|bg|'''От''' моята къща се вижда морето.}}
#:: Ot mojata kǎšta se vižda moreto.
#:: From my house the sea can be seen.''
#: {{lang|bg|наляво '''от''' вратата}}
#:: naljavo ot vratata
#:: left of the door''
#: {{lang|bg|'''от''' лявата ми страна}}
#:: ot ljavata mi strana
#:: on my left''
# ''used to show separation or removal'', [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{lang|bg|изваждам три '''от''' десет}}
#:: izvaždam tri ot deset
#:: to take three (away) from ten''
#: {{lang|bg|отстранявам '''от''' училище}}
#:: otstranjavam ot učilište
#:: to expel from school''
# ''used to indicate a starting point in time'', [[from#Preposition|from]], [[since#Preposition|since]]
#: {{lang|bg|Беше сляп '''от''' раждането си.}}
#:: Beše sljap ot raždaneto si.
#:: He was blind from birth.''
#: {{lang|bg|Започвам работа '''от''' понеделник.}}
#:: Započvam rabota ot ponedelnik.
#:: I'm starting work from Monday.''
#: {{lang|bg|Познавам я '''от''' миналата година.}}
#:: Poznavam ja ot minalata godina.
#:: I have known her since last year.''
# ''used to show the group someone/something belongs to'', [[of#Preposition|of]]
#: {{lang|bg|един '''от''' нас}}
#:: edin ot nas
#:: one of us''
#: {{lang|bg|трима '''от''' приятелите му}}
#:: trima ot prijatelite mu
#:: three of his friends''
# ''used to indicate an indefinite amount of something'', [[some]] (of), a [[part]] of, a [[piece]] of
#: {{lang|bg|Някой беше пил '''от''' виното.}}
#:: Njakoj beše pil ot vinoto.
#:: Someone had drunk some of the wine.''
#: {{lang|bg|Яде ли '''от''' тортата?}}
#:: Jade li ot tortata?
#:: Did you have a piece of the cake?''
# ''used to indicate the origin of someone/something'', [[from#Preposition|from]], [[of#Preposition|of]]
#: {{lang|bg|Аз съм '''от''' България.}}
#:: Az sǎm ot Bǎlgarija.
#:: I'm from Bulgaria''
#: {{lang|bg|Това вино идва '''от''' Франция.}}
#:: Tova vino idva ot Francija.
#:: This wine comes from France.''
#: {{lang|bg|родом '''от'''}}
#:: rodom ot
#:: born in/native of''
#: {{lang|bg|деца '''от''' първия брак}}
#:: deca ot pǎrvija brak
#:: children of the first marriage''
#: {{lang|bg|студент '''от''' университета}}
#:: student ot universiteta
#:: a student of/from the university''
# ''used to indicate what something is made of or consists of'', [[from#Preposition|from]], [[of#Preposition|of]], [[out of#Preposition|out of]]
#: {{lang|bg|Сиренето се прави '''от''' мляко.}}
#:: sireneto se pravi ot mljako
#:: Cheese is made from/out of milk.''
#: {{lang|bg|кутия '''от''' дърво}}
#:: kutija ot dǎrvo
#:: a box made of wood''
#: {{lang|bg|тълпа '''от''' хора}}
#:: tǎlpa ot hora
#:: a crowd of people''
#: {{lang|bg|армия '''от''' просяци}}
#:: armija ot prosjaci
#:: an army of beggars''
# ''used to show the source that provides something'', [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{lang|bg|писмо '''от''' брат ми}}
#:: pismo ot brat mi
#:: a letter from my brother''
#: {{lang|bg|информация '''от''' очевидци}}
#:: informacija ot očevidci
#:: information from witnesses''
#: {{lang|bg|уча се '''от''' грешките си}}
#:: uča se ot greškite si
#:: to learn from one's mistakes''
#: {{lang|bg|'''От''' това, което чух, той е получил сърдечен удар.}}
#:: Ot tova, koeto čuh, toj e polučil sǎrdečen udar.
#:: From what I heard he had a heart attack.''
#: {{lang|bg|купувам нещо '''от''' някого}}
#:: kupuvam nešto ot njakogo
#:: to buy something from somebody''
#: {{lang|bg|купувам '''от''' магазин}}
#:: kupuvam ot magazin
#:: to buy from/at/in a shop''
#: {{lang|bg|пия '''от''' чаша}}
#:: pija ot čaša
#:: to drink from/out of a glass''
#: {{lang|bg|преписвам '''от''' книга}}
#:: prepisvam ot kniga
#:: to copy out of a book''
# ''used to show the person or thing someone/something is afraid of, ashamed of, saved from, hidden from, etc.'', [[from#Preposition|from]], [[of#Preposition|of]]
#: {{lang|bg|Страхувам се '''от''' кучета.}}
#:: Strahuvam se ot kučeta.
#:: I'm afraid of dogs.''
#: {{lang|bg|Срам ме е '''от''' това, което направих.}}
#:: Sram me e ot tova, koeta napravih.
#:: I'm ashamed of what I have done.''
#: {{lang|bg|Той беше спасен '''от''' удавяне.}}
#:: Toj beše spasen ot udavjane.
#:: He was saved from drowning.''
#: {{lang|bg|Какво криеш '''от''' мен?}}
#:: Kakvo krieš ot men?
#:: What are you hiding from me?
#: {{lang|bg|Това лекарство лекува '''от''' много болести.}}
#:: Tova lekarstvo lekuva ot mnogo bolesti.
#:: This medicine cures many illnesses.''
#: {{lang|bg|отървавам се '''от''' някого}}
#:: otǎrvavam se ot njakogo
#:: to get rid of someone''
# ''used when comparing or distinguishing things, to introduce the basis of comparison/distinction'', [[than#Preposition|than]], [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{lang|bg|По-висок съм '''от''' нея.}}
#:: Po-visok sǎm ot neja.
#:: I'm taller than her.''
#: {{lang|bg|Мария е различна '''от''' Виктория.}}
#:: Marija e različna ot Viktorija.
#:: Maria is different from Victoria.''
#: {{lang|bg|Не мога да различа единия '''от''' другия.}}
#:: Ne moga da različa edinija ot drugija.
#:: I can't distinguish one from the other.''
# ''used to indicate the actor in a clause with its verb in the passive voice'', [[by#Preposition|by]]
#: {{lang|bg|Лодката беше залята '''от''' водата.}}
#:: Lodkata beše zaljata ot vodata.
#:: The boat was swamped by the water.''
#: {{lang|bg|роман '''от''' Дикенс}}
#:: roman ot Dikens
#:: a novel by Dickens''
# ''used to show the reason for something'', [[from#Preposition|from]], [[out of#Preposition|out of]], [[with#Preposition|with]], [[of#Preposition|of]], [[through#Preposition|through]]
#: {{lang|bg|заспивам '''от''' умора}}
#:: zaspivam ot umora
#:: to fall asleep from weariness/with fatigue''
#: {{lang|bg|очи, зачервени '''от''' плач}}
#:: oči, začerveni ot plač
#:: eyes red from weeping''
#: {{lang|bg|умирам '''от''' болест/глад}}
#:: umiram ot bolest/glad
#:: to die of an illness/of hunger''
#: {{lang|bg|треперя '''от''' студ}}
#:: treperja ot stud
#:: to shake with cold''
#: {{lang|bg|викам '''от''' яд/отчаяние}}
#:: vikam ot jad/otčajanie
#:: to shout in anger/despair''
#: {{lang|bg|питам '''от''' любопитство}}
#:: pitam ot ljubopitstvo
#:: to ask out of curiosity''
#: {{lang|bg|'''от''' нужда/завист}}
#:: ot nužda/zavist
#:: out of necessity/envy''
#: {{lang|bg|'''от''' мързел/невнимание}}
#:: ot mǎrzel/nevnimanie
#:: through laziness/carelessness''
# ''used to show the state of somebody/something before a change'', [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{lang|bg|Нещата станаха '''от''' лоши по-лоши.}}
#:: Neštata stanaha ot loši po-loši.
#:: Things have gone from bad to worse.''
#: {{lang|bg|превеждам '''от''' български на английски}}
#:: preveždam ot bǎlgarski na anglijski
#:: to translate from Bulgarian to English''
#: {{lang|bg|събуждам се '''от''' сън}}
#:: sǎbuždam se ot sǎn
#:: to wake up from sleep''
# ''used to show where somebody/something was before they/it changed place'', [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{lang|bg|вървя '''от''' град '''на''' град}}
#:: vǎrvja ot grad na grad
#:: to go from one town to another''
# ''used to indicate the range of something'', [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{lang|bg|'''от''' сутрин до вечер}}
#:: ot sutrin do večer
#:: from morning till night''
#: {{lang|bg|'''от''' понеделник до петък}}
#:: ot ponedelnik do petǎk
#:: from Monday till Friday''
#: {{lang|bg|'''от''' глава до пети}}
#:: ot glava do peti
#:: from head to toe''
#: {{lang|bg|Магазинът работи '''от''' 9 до 18.}}
#:: Magazinǎt raboti ot 9 do 18.
#:: The shop's open from 9 to 18.''
# ''used to indicate the amount of time that has passed since the beginning of something'', [[for#Preposition|for]]
#: {{lang|bg|Познавам я '''от''' четири години.}}
#:: Poznavam ja ot četiri godini.
#:: I have known her for four years.''
#: {{lang|bg|Не съм го виждал '''от''' известно време.}}
#:: Ne sǎm go viždal ot izvestno vreme.
#:: I haven't seen him for a while.''

